WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.935
-Welcome back, everybody. We're
hanging out with Jared Leto.

00:00:02.935 --> 00:00:05.338
Now, Jared,
last time you were on the show,

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:09.241
we competed in a segment called
"30 Seconds To..."

00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:11.210
in honor of your band,
Thirty Seconds to Mars,

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.279
where we each had 30 seconds
to complete

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:14.947
a series
of very important challenges.

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:16.982
Well, I think it's time
for a rematch.

00:00:16.982 --> 00:00:20.119
This is "30 Seconds To..."
rematch.

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:22.321 line:0%
-♪ "30 Seconds To..." ♪

00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:23.957 line:0%
-♪ Rematch ♪

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:26.359
-Okay, buddy,
are you ready for this, man?

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:29.262
-I'm so ready. Are you ready?
-I don't know.

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:31.063
-I got to tuck my hair back --
I'm so ready.

00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:32.565
I'm...
-I know. I know.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:35.034
For this first challenge,
we have to use straws

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:37.736
to transport
as many Goldfish Crackers

00:00:37.736 --> 00:00:41.841
from one plate to another place
without using our hands.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:45.745
After 30 seconds, whoever has
moved the most Goldfish wins.

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:47.046
Sound good?

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:48.047
Ready...

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.148
set...

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:50.249
go!

00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:58.891
♪♪

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:05.464
♪♪

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:06.966
How's
Jared doing?

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:14.707
♪♪

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.943
[ Laughs ]

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:19.378
♪♪

00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:21.114
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:23.516
-Ah!
Ah-ah-ah-ah!

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:25.418
-Whew, yeah.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.921
You get a little
of that Goldfish dust.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.355
-I think I brought one down.

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:31.790
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:33.326
-[ Sighs ]
-Alright, let's count --

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:34.627
see how many you got there.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:38.063
I got 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7...

00:01:38.063 --> 00:01:40.099
17.

00:01:40.099 --> 00:01:41.968
[ Laughs ]
-22, man.

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.435
Come on, now!
-Come on, man.

00:01:43.435 --> 00:01:44.737
[ Bell dinging ]
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:45.905
-Come on!
-Alright.

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:48.941
Round 1 goes to Jared Leto.
-Come on!

00:01:48.941 --> 00:01:51.477
-For the next challenge,
we have 30 seconds

00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:54.780
to unwrap as many
Hershey's Kisses as possible

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.183
while wearing oven mitts.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:59.319
I think
I have a strategy to this.

00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:00.820
-You do?
-Yuh-huh, yeah.

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.022
-[ Chuckles ] Okay, okay.
-I'm going for the win, man.

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:04.356
-Ready...set...

00:02:04.356 --> 00:02:05.625
-2 for 2.
-...go!

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:11.264
♪♪

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:13.533 line:0%
Gosh, did not work!
I'm so mad.

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:16.235 line:0%
[ Laughing ] Oh, my God.
That was my strategy.

00:02:16.235 --> 00:02:18.604 line:0%
Oh, God.

00:02:18.604 --> 00:02:21.373 line:0%
Can you use your teeth?
Ooh.

00:02:21.373 --> 00:02:23.842 line:0%
Jamesy, you did one.

00:02:23.842 --> 00:02:26.212 line:0%
How you doing, Jared?

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:29.048 line:0%
-Oh, man,
what are you talking about?

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.516 line:0%
-[ Breathes sharply ]
Did you crush these?

00:02:30.516 --> 00:02:33.319 line:0%
-This is not a hobby, my friend.
This is not a hobby.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:36.021
-I got --
I got --

00:02:36.021 --> 00:02:37.823
[ Buzzer ]
Alright.

00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:41.894
I think I know who probably won
this, but, gosh, I got four.

00:02:41.894 --> 00:02:44.430
-[ Chuckles ]
-[ Sighs ] It looks sad, too.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.199
-Wait. You got four?
That's pretty good.

00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:48.768
I got one...
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:50.970
-...two Kisses...
-[ Laughs ] Two Kisses.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.339
-...three Kisses...
-Yeah.

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:54.741
-...four Kisses...
-Yeah.

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:55.942
-How many -- five?

00:02:55.942 --> 00:02:57.643
-Five!
-Oh, my gosh!

00:02:57.643 --> 00:02:58.878
One extra Kiss?!
[ Bell dinging ]

00:02:58.878 --> 00:02:59.945
You know what?
I messed up --

00:02:59.945 --> 00:03:01.280
my strategy
messed my whole thing up.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.749
I thought I was gonna use,
like, a garlic

00:03:03.749 --> 00:03:05.618
and do, like,
a whew, whew, whew,

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:08.288
but then it did not work at all.

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:09.521
Gosh!

00:03:09.521 --> 00:03:11.257
On to the next challenge.

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:15.061
For our final challenge,
we have 30 seconds to

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:18.531
wrap ourselves in as much
toilet paper as possible.

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:22.769
Whoever gets the most
toilet paper on their body wins.

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:25.971
-Jimmy, this single-ply, man --
this is like --

00:03:25.971 --> 00:03:27.840
-Look, look, we're in --
I know, but, look --

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.942
Come on. We'll --
We'll discuss the budget later.

00:03:29.942 --> 00:03:31.177
-[ Chuckling ]
Okay. Let's go.

00:03:31.177 --> 00:03:32.712
-You ready for this?
-Let's go. I'm ready.

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:34.547
-Ready...set...
-Yeah.

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:36.048
-..go!

00:03:36.048 --> 00:03:38.351
♪♪

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:40.920 line:0%
Oh, it is single-ply.
Darn it.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:44.023 line:0%
-I had a strategy. I don't know
if it's gonna work, though.

00:03:44.023 --> 00:03:47.026 line:0%
-Oh, gosh. Mine's just ripping
and tearing off.

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:48.627
This is so...

00:03:48.627 --> 00:03:50.663 line:0%
-Told you -- it's single-ply.
-I know that --

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:52.298 line:0%
single-ply is a rough...
-Single-ply.

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:53.799 line:0%
-Darn it. Oh!

00:03:53.799 --> 00:03:56.235 line:0%
I can't even...

00:03:56.235 --> 00:03:59.005 line:0%
Oh, this --
this is cheap toilet paper!

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:00.206
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:00.206 --> 00:04:01.240
-Oh, my gosh.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:03.576 line:0%
This is so --
This is ridiculous.

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:04.910
Ohh.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:06.011
[ Buzzer ]

00:04:06.011 --> 00:04:09.147
You're joking.

00:04:09.147 --> 00:04:10.616
-It was a close call.

00:04:10.616 --> 00:04:12.718
-This is a pretty close call,
'cause I almost did, like,

00:04:12.718 --> 00:04:14.787
an "I Dream of Jeannie"
type of thing,

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:17.623
and what you did
was the correct thing.

00:04:17.623 --> 00:04:18.957
The winner is...

00:04:18.957 --> 00:04:20.026
Jared Leto.
[ Bell dinging ]

00:04:20.026 --> 00:04:22.127
Crushed me in this
"30 Seconds To..."

00:04:22.127 --> 00:04:26.165
Oh, my goodness.
Jared Leto, everyone, the champ!

